<subpara id="X39400001KV00TC_12" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___0000D7S00000">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), read the freeze frame data. The freeze frame data records part of the engine operating condition when the malfunction occurred, and this information is useful when troubleshooting.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>First perform troubleshooting for DTCs P0365/18, P0367/18, P0368/18, P0390/18, P0392/18, P0393/18; if no malfunctioning area is found, a mechanical system malfunction is suspected.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
</content5>
</subpara>
